<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN SATURDAY SCHEDULE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN SATURDAY SCHEDULE.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule on the show courts on</p>
<p>the sixth day of the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Saturday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Centre Court (2345 GMT Friday start)</p>
<p>10-Albert Costa (Spain) v Scott Draper (Australia)</p>
<p>Dominique van Roost (Belgium) v 2-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario</p>
<p>(Spain)</p>
<p>11-Jim Courier (U.S.) v Jeff Tarango (U.S.)</p>
<p>Night session (0800 GMT start)</p>
<p>Barbara Schett (Austria) v 4-Martina Hingis (Switzerland)</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v Mark Woodforde (Australia)</p>
<p>Court One (Midnight GMT start)</p>
<p>8-Irina Spirlea (Romania) v Silvia Farina (Italy)</p>
<p>Renzo Furlan (Italy) v 8-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa)</p>
<p>3-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) v Chris Woodruff (U.S.)</p>
<p>Court Two (Midnight GMT start)</p>
<p>Wang Shi-Ting (Taiwan) v 9-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) v 16-Alberto Berasategui (Spain)</p>
</text>
